really a swamp.

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:03,890
It's a river.

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,320
Water spills south

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,560
from Lake Okeechobee

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:07,480
and spreads into

7
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,460
a shallow sheet

8
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,100
up to about

9
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,090
sixty miles wide.

10
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:11,860
It creeps toward

11
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,000
Florida Bay so

12
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,120
slowly you can

13
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:14,880
barely see

14
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,900
